<title>SENEGAL: Senegal grants Canadian firm diamond search permit.</title>
<headline>Senegal grants Canadian firm diamond search permit.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senegal granted Canadian company Diamond Works Ltd a permit to prospect for diamonds, the West African country's director of mines said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Abdoulaye Dia told Reuters the Vancouver based company had similar projects in Zambia and Namibia.</p>
<p>Experts say there are indications of alluvial diamond deposits in the east.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
